+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/generate-fy — add the fiscal year's twelve monthly periods, from the sheet's fiscal year start
+# month of the year on, exactly as generate-periods does (a month whose name the sheet already has, or whose days overlap
+# a period, is left out). Body: { "year": "yyyy" } (a fiscal year is named by the calendar year its first day falls in).
+# A year that is not four digits is refused. Responds { "generated": n }.
